ession weapon, great for sustained fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mac-11</strong> (Standard &amp; Suppressor) – A fast-firing, compact SMG.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sniper Rifles:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SVD Dragunov</strong> – A classic semi-automatic sniper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>M-14 Sniper</strong> – Precision rifle with a tactical edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VSS Sniper</strong> (Single &amp; Automatic Fire) – Unique, suppressed sniper rifle with versatile fire modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.357 American Sniper</strong> – High-caliber bolt-action rifle for long-range kills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secondary Weapons:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colt 1911 Pistol</strong> – A legendary sidearm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beretta 9mm</strong> – Well-rounded and reliable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOCOM</strong> – Tactical pistol with elite military use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sig Sauer .45</strong> – A powerful semi-auto handgun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Melee &amp; Special Weapons:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bowie Knife</strong> – Classic combat blade for silent takedowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana Sword</strong> – A high-style, deadly melee option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch / Kick / CQC</strong> – Hand-to-hand combat for brutal takedowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>American Thompson</strong> – A historic SMG with nostalgic appeal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toy Foam Dart Repeater</strong> – A fun, gimmick weapon for lighthearted combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>YOU'RE INVITED!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/cc67b733ffae65599c5237380dd895f0.avif?t=1742235589\" width=612 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord and help influence the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord where you are encourge you to leave feedback and feature requests and participate in scheduled group gaming sessions. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/extras/97df3fe7f22fbad569edba9d593b8392.webp?t=1742235589\" width=720 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My brother and I are actively developing and improving our game, aiming to deliver a high-quality experience for military game enthusiasts. As our skills grow, we’ll continue refining the game, implementing new features, and listening to player feedback. We’d love for you to join us on this journey—your support and input mean a lot. Hope you enjoy the game!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Kevin &amp; Sean, the Devs</i></p>", "short_description": "In POPS, every bullet fired pushes you further into the chaos of war. The story-driven campaign throws you into the boots of an elite operative. Fight through a series of intense missions, face overwhelming odds, unexpected betrayals, and brutal firefights where only the strongest survive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/header.jpg?t=1742235589", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/ea09f5d065ffe6af373b9f0729a0463957c1a071/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742235589", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2188260/ea09f5d065ffe6af373b9f0729a0463957c1a071/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742235589", "website": "https://pixelsgraphicdesign.com/portableops/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "2023 © Sean Smith, Pixels Graphic Design.", "developers": ["Sean Smith", "Outlaw Games"], "publishers": ["Pixels Graphic Design"], "demos": [{"appid": 2704500, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1499, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$14.99"}, "packages": [783389], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Portable Ops", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recur